      "revision": 1367361652,
      "text": "Albizia coriaria is a deciduous tree native to Tropical Africa belonging to the family Fabaceae, the root and stem bark are widely used in traditional medicine to treat a variety of diseases."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Albizia coriaria",
